X: 1
T: Skid Row
O: Alan Menken, 1982
N: The opening ensemble number of Little Shop of Horrors. Melody (channel 1) of
N: a hamienet.com MIDI (id 7927), moved down ten semitones from Bb major to C so
N: the range fits the recorder exactly (C4 to A5); chords fitted from the
N: accompaniment (C7 vamp, Em7-B7 lift, F7 answers, Am7 holds). The pushing
N: offbeat entries are straightened; pitches are the source's. Scope: the
N: "Down on Skid Row" chorus, complete with its rising sequence and hold (source
N: bars 11-30); the Eb5 and F#4 of the lift are the source's chromatics.
L: 1/8
Q: 1/4=120
M: 4/4
K: C
